---
import PageLayout from "@layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { CONTACT, SITE } from "@consts";
---

<PageLayout title={CONTACT.TITLE} description={CONTACT.DESCRIPTION}>
<div class="pt-4">
  <div class="border-2" style="border-color: var(--border);">
    <div class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold" style="background-color: var(--fg); color: var(--bg);">contact</div>
    <div class="p-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
      <p>
The fastest way to reach me is email at
<a href={`mailto:${SITE.EMAIL}`} class="font-bold">{SITE.EMAIL}</a>.
I read everything sent to that address and reply to anything concrete: a question about a post, a bug report against one of my projects, a consulting or collaboration enquiry, or a correction I should publish.
      </p>
      <p>
For recruiting and contract work, include the role, the team, and the stack in your first message. Messages without enough context to judge fit tend to stall.
      </p>
      <p>
I am also reachable on the profiles below. Those channels are better for quick public questions than for anything private; assume anything posted there is public.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-2 mt-5" style="border-color: var(--border);">
    <div class="px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold" style="background-color: var(--fg); color: var(--bg);">profiles</div>
    <div class="p-3 text-sm flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1">
      <a href="https://github.com/bxrne" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bxrne" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://twitter.com/abxrne" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Twitter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</PageLayout>
